OL,3,GNEWSASchools in lockdown and boy in
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police are searching for a male
OL,7,Farmed with a blade as two schools are
OL,8,Fin lockdown and a boy is in hospital.
OL,10,FGloucestershire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled shortly after 08:50 GMT to a
OL,12,Freport of an altercation on Chalford
OL,13,FRoad, near to St Peter's High School in
OL,14,FTuffley.
OL,16,FArmed officers are now searching for
OL,17,Fthose involved who fled the area,
OL,18,Fpolice said. The force said one boy had
OL,19,Fbeen taken to hospital with minor
OL,20,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
