OL,3,GNEWSASchools in lockdown and boy in
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Peter's High School and nearby
OL,7,FWillow Primary Academy are locked down
OL,8,Fand officers asked parents not to
OL,9,Fattend. A police spokesperson said
OL,10,Fthere was "no ongoing threat at the
OL,11,Fschool" and pupils were safe within the
OL,12,Fschool grounds.
